    "Blocks banners, pop-ups and video ads from 80+ ad networks including Google Ads, Facebook Ads, Taboola, Outbrain and others. Pages load faster and look cleaner." : {
      "comment" : "Tooltip text for the \"General Ads\" filter category.",
      "isCommentAutoGenerated" : true,
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Bloquea banners, ventanas emergentes y anuncios de vídeo de más de 80 redes, incluidas Google Ads, Facebook Ads, Taboola, Outbrain y otras. Las páginas cargan más rápido y se ven más limpias."
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Google Ads、Facebook Ads、Taboola、Outbrainなど80以上の広告ネットワークのバナー、ポップアップ、動画広告をブロックします。ページの読み込みが速くなり、表示もすっきりします。"
          }
        },
        "pt-BR" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Bloqueia banners, pop-ups e anúncios em vídeo de mais de 80 redes, incluindo Google Ads, Facebook Ads, Taboola, Outbrain e outras. As páginas carregam mais rápido e ficam mais limpas."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Blocks loading of 60+ gambling and betting sites by domain — casinos, sportsbooks and poker rooms. Works across all regional domains (.com, .ru, etc.)." : {
